{
  "name": "Report Zammad ticket outcomes to Hesperan",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Report outcomes to Hesperan\n\n**Who it's for:** anyone running the *Zammad ticket triage* template.\n\n**What it does:** when a ticket is closed, its final group is the right answer. The workflow looks up the Hesperan decision stored for the ticket and reports that answer as the outcome. Tickets a person re-routed count as corrections. The Hesperan console then shows the live precision of automated decisions and warns when it drifts from the target.\n\nReport all outcomes (or a random sample), not only corrections, or the precision you see will be too low. Each decision takes one outcome; the same answer again is accepted, a different one is refused. Outcomes are free.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Hesperan credential (API key `hsp_…`).\n2. In Zammad, a Trigger *Ticket state is closed → Webhook* to this workflow's production URL.\n3. The Data Table `hesperan_decisions` filled by the triage template.\n4. Profile answers must equal Zammad group names; otherwise map them in **Report outcome**.",
        "height": 600,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "5c887e28-e240-58a3-b9a2-e06881ab3cbf",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -600,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "hesperan-zammad-ticket-closed",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bf6906f5-9a21-5cfc-948e-3ca5d31ba35d",
      "name": "Zammad: ticket closed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "e64da534-66db-58df-8ddb-34751f73ce7f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "get",
        "dataTableId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "hesperan_decisions"
        },
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "ticket_id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ String($json.body.ticket.id) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "limit": 1
      },
      "id": "c9b2bd4f-8f9a-51cc-9100-a6a03c8cf4c7",
      "name": "Find decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.dataTable",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "decision",
        "operation": "reportOutcome",
        "decisionId": "={{ $json.decision_id }}",
        "profile": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "slug",
          "value": "ticket-routing"
        },
        "actual": "={{ $('Zammad: ticket closed').item.json.body.ticket.group.name }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "23df5792-175e-5cef-b1ff-4c32c7806c1a",
      "name": "Report outcome",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-hesperan.hesperan",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Zammad: ticket closed": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Find decision",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Find decision": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Report outcome",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  },
  "tags": []
}
